<title>USA: Arterial Vascular stent gets OK from Japan.</title>
<headline>Arterial Vascular stent gets OK from Japan.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc said Wednesday it received approval from the Japanese Ministry of Health and Welfare to sell its entire line of coronary stent systems in that country.</p>
<p>Arterial Vascular said it is still waiting for reimbursement approval from the ministry but does not expect that approval before fourth calendar quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Shares of Arterial Vascular gained 3-3/4 to 34-1/2 in midday trading.</p>
<p>(( New York newsdesk 212-859-1610 ))</p>
